---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer - ipofins" description="Important disclaimer about ipofins financial tools and content. Not SEBI registered investment advice.">
  <section class="container-narrow py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-surface-900 dark:text-white">Disclaimer</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-base font-medium text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-200">Investment in securities market is subject to market risks. Read all the related documents carefully before investing.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white pt-4">Not Investment Advice</h2>
      <p>ipofins is not a SEBI-registered Research Analyst or Investment Advisor. The information, tools, and AI-generated analysis on this website are for educational and informational purposes only. They do not constitute investment advice, recommendations, or solicitation to buy or sell securities.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white pt-4">AI Analysis Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>AI scores, risk ratings, and verdicts displayed on this platform are generated by machine learning models. They are not guaranteed to be accurate and should not be the sole basis for investment decisions. Past performance does not guarantee future results.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white pt-4">Data Accuracy</h2>
      <p>While we source data from official channels (AMFI, BSE, NSE), information may be delayed up to 12 hours, incomplete, or contain errors. Always verify with official sources before investing.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white pt-4">GMP (Grey Market Premium)</h2>
      <p>GMP data is sourced from unofficial grey market sources. Grey market transactions are not regulated by SEBI or any exchange. GMP is speculative and may not reflect actual listing prices.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
